@startuml restaurant-order-complete-flow

title Sistema de Gestión y Despacho de Pedidos de Restaurante\nFlujo completo alineado al modelo SQL + ER

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "Administrator" as Admin
actor "Cook" as Cook
actor "Courier" as Courier
actor "Customer" as CustomerUser

participant "Terminal UI\n(o JavaFX)" as UI

box "Spring Boot Application"
participant "AccessController" as AccessC
participant "OrderController" as OrderC
participant "TrackingController" as TrackC

participant "StaffService" as StaffS
participant "OrderService" as OrderS
participant "OrderQueryService" as QueryS
participant "DeliveryService" as DelivS
participant "StateTransitionService" as TransS

participant "RoleRepository" as RoleRepo
participant "StaffRepository" as StaffRepo
participant "CustomerRepository" as CustomerRepo
participant "CustomerAddressRepository" as AddressRepo
participant "ProductRepository" as ProductRepo
participant "OrderStatusRepository" as StatusRepo
participant "OrderStatusTransitionRuleRepository" as RuleRepo
participant "CustomerOrderRepository" as OrderRepo
participant "OrderItemRepository" as ItemRepo
participant "OrderStatusHistoryRepository" as HistoryRepo
participant "DeliveryRepository" as DeliveryRepo
end box

database "MySQL" as MySQL

== 0. Identificación operativa del staff ==

Admin -> UI : ingresa username
UI -> AccessC : POST /staff/identify(username)
AccessC -> StaffS : identifyActiveStaff(username)
StaffS -> StaffRepo : findByUsername(username)
StaffRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM staff WHERE username = ?
MySQL --> StaffRepo : Staff
StaffS -> RoleRepo : findById(staff.roleId)
RoleRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM roles WHERE role_id = ?
MySQL --> RoleRepo : Role
StaffS --> AccessC : Staff + Role
AccessC --> UI : acceso operativo + menú según rol
UI --> Admin : muestra menú de Administrador

note right of StaffS
El modelo vigente guarda:
- staff.username
- staff.role_id
- staff.is_active

NO modela password.
La identificación es operativa/demostrativa,
no autenticación completa.
end note

== 1. Administrador consulta menú ==

Admin -> UI : consulta menú disponible
UI -> OrderC : GET /products?available=true
OrderC -> QueryS : getAvailableProducts()
QueryS -> ProductRepo : findByIsAvailableTrue()
ProductRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM products WHERE is_available = true
MySQL --> ProductRepo : Product[]
QueryS --> OrderC : lista de productos
OrderC --> UI : menú disponible
UI --> Admin : muestra productos

== 2. Administrador crea pedido ==

Admin -> UI : registra cliente, dirección e ítems
UI -> OrderC : POST /orders(customerData, addressData|addressId, items, registeredByStaffId)
OrderC -> OrderS : createOrder(...)

OrderS -> StaffS : validateStaffRole(registeredByStaffId, ADMINISTRATOR)
StaffS -> StaffRepo : findById(registeredByStaffId)
StaffRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM staff WHERE staff_id = ?
MySQL --> StaffRepo : Staff
StaffS -> RoleRepo : findById(staff.roleId)
RoleRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM roles WHERE role_id = ?
MySQL --> RoleRepo : Role(ADMINISTRATOR)
StaffS --> OrderS : Staff válido

OrderS -> CustomerRepo : findByEmail(customer.email)
CustomerRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM customers WHERE email = ?
alt cliente ya existe
  MySQL --> CustomerRepo : Customer
else cliente no existe
  MySQL --> CustomerRepo : null
  OrderS -> CustomerRepo : save(Customer)
  CustomerRepo -> MySQL : INSERT INTO customers(...)
  MySQL --> CustomerRepo : Customer creado
end

alt se usa una dirección existente
  OrderS -> AddressRepo : findByIdAndIsActiveTrue(addressId)
  AddressRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM customer_addresses WHERE address_id = ? AND is_active = true
  MySQL --> AddressRepo : CustomerAddress
  OrderS -> OrderS : valida que address.customer_id = customer.customer_id
else se registra una nueva dirección
  OrderS -> AddressRepo : save(CustomerAddress)
  AddressRepo -> MySQL : INSERT INTO customer_addresses(customer_id, alias, main_street, city, province, country, ...)
  MySQL --> AddressRepo : CustomerAddress creada
end

OrderS -> ProductRepo : findAllById(productIds)
ProductRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM products WHERE product_id IN (...)
MySQL --> ProductRepo : Product[]

OrderS -> StatusRepo : findByStatusCode("PENDING")
StatusRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM order_statuses WHERE status_code = 'PENDING'
MySQL --> StatusRepo : OrderStatus(PENDING / Pendiente)

OrderS -> OrderRepo : save(CustomerOrder + deliveryAddressSnapshot)
OrderRepo -> MySQL : INSERT INTO customer_orders(...)
MySQL --> OrderRepo : CustomerOrder creada

OrderS -> ItemRepo : saveAll(OrderItem[])
ItemRepo -> MySQL : INSERT INTO order_items(...)
MySQL --> ItemRepo : OrderItem[] creados

OrderS -> HistoryRepo : save(initial OrderStatusHistory)
HistoryRepo -> MySQL : INSERT INTO order_status_histories(...)
MySQL --> HistoryRepo : historial inicial creado

OrderS --> OrderC : orderCode + total + status=PENDING
OrderC --> UI : pedido registrado correctamente
UI --> Admin : muestra código del pedido y total

note right of OrderS
Entidades/tablas involucradas:
- customers
- customer_addresses
- products
- customer_orders
- order_items
- order_statuses
- order_status_histories

Reglas aplicadas:
- delivery_address_id es obligatorio
- city y province son obligatorias
- country usa Ecuador por defecto
- delivery_address_snapshot preserva el histórico
- status_code es la clave operativa
- status_name es la etiqueta visible
- total_amount = subtotal + tax + surcharge - discount
end note

== 3. Cocinero consulta pedidos PENDING ==

Cook -> UI : ingresa username
UI -> AccessC : POST /staff/identify(username)
AccessC -> StaffS : identifyActiveStaff(username)
StaffS -> StaffRepo : findByUsername(username)
StaffRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM staff WHERE username = ?
MySQL --> StaffRepo : Staff
StaffS -> RoleRepo : findById(staff.roleId)
RoleRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM roles WHERE role_id = ?
MySQL --> RoleRepo : Role(COOK)
StaffS --> AccessC : Staff + Role
AccessC --> UI : acceso operativo
UI --> Cook : muestra menú de Cocinero

Cook -> UI : consulta pedidos pendientes
UI -> OrderC : GET /orders?statusCode=PENDING
OrderC -> QueryS : getOrdersByStatus("PENDING")
QueryS -> OrderRepo : findByCurrentStatusStatusCode("PENDING")
OrderRepo -> MySQL : SELECT co.* FROM customer_orders co JOIN order_statuses os ON os.status_id = co.current_status_id WHERE os.status_code = 'PENDING'
MySQL --> OrderRepo : CustomerOrder[]
QueryS --> OrderC : pedidos pendientes
OrderC --> UI : lista de pedidos
UI --> Cook : muestra pedidos pendientes

== 4. Cocinero cambia PENDING -> IN_PREPARATION ==

Cook -> UI : toma pedido para preparar
UI -> OrderC : PATCH /orders/{orderCode}/status = IN_PREPARATION
OrderC -> OrderS : changeOrderStatus(orderCode, "IN_PREPARATION", cookStaffId, notes)

OrderS -> OrderRepo : findByOrderCode(orderCode)
OrderRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM customer_orders WHERE order_code = ?
MySQL --> OrderRepo : CustomerOrder

OrderS -> StaffS : validateStaffRole(cookStaffId, COOK)
StaffS -> StaffRepo : findById(cookStaffId)
StaffRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM staff WHERE staff_id = ?
MySQL --> StaffRepo : Staff
StaffS -> RoleRepo : findById(staff.roleId)
RoleRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM roles WHERE role_id = ?
MySQL --> RoleRepo : Role(COOK)
StaffS --> OrderS : Staff válido

OrderS -> StatusRepo : findByStatusCode("IN_PREPARATION")
StatusRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM order_statuses WHERE status_code = 'IN_PREPARATION'
MySQL --> StatusRepo : OrderStatus(IN_PREPARATION / En preparación)

OrderS -> TransS : validateTransition(PENDING, IN_PREPARATION, COOK)
TransS -> RuleRepo : existsByFromStatusStatusCodeAndToStatusStatusCodeAndRoleRoleNameAndIsActiveTrue(...)
RuleRepo -> MySQL : SELECT 1 FROM order_status_transition_rules r JOIN order_statuses fs ON fs.status_id = r.from_status_id JOIN order_statuses ts ON ts.status_id = r.to_status_id JOIN roles ro ON ro.role_id = r.role_id WHERE fs.status_code = 'PENDING' AND ts.status_code = 'IN_PREPARATION' AND ro.role_name = 'COOK' AND r.is_active = true
MySQL --> RuleRepo : existe regla

OrderS -> OrderRepo : save(currentStatus=IN_PREPARATION, currentStatusChangedAt=now)
OrderRepo -> MySQL : UPDATE customer_orders SET current_status_id = ?, current_status_changed_at = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP(6) WHERE order_id = ?
MySQL --> OrderRepo : CustomerOrder actualizada

OrderS -> HistoryRepo : save(PENDING -> IN_PREPARATION)
HistoryRepo -> MySQL : INSERT INTO order_status_histories(...)
MySQL --> HistoryRepo : historial creado

OrderS --> OrderC : estado actualizado
OrderC --> UI : pedido en preparación
UI --> Cook : confirmación

== 5. Cocinero cambia IN_PREPARATION -> READY ==

Cook -> UI : marca pedido como listo
UI -> OrderC : PATCH /orders/{orderCode}/status = READY
OrderC -> OrderS : changeOrderStatus(orderCode, "READY", cookStaffId, notes)

OrderS -> OrderRepo : findByOrderCode(orderCode)
OrderRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM customer_orders WHERE order_code = ?
MySQL --> OrderRepo : CustomerOrder

OrderS -> StatusRepo : findByStatusCode("READY")
StatusRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM order_statuses WHERE status_code = 'READY'
MySQL --> StatusRepo : OrderStatus(READY / Listo)

OrderS -> TransS : validateTransition(IN_PREPARATION, READY, COOK)
TransS -> RuleRepo : existsByFromStatusStatusCodeAndToStatusStatusCodeAndRoleRoleNameAndIsActiveTrue(...)
RuleRepo -> MySQL : SELECT 1 FROM order_status_transition_rules r JOIN order_statuses fs ON fs.status_id = r.from_status_id JOIN order_statuses ts ON ts.status_id = r.to_status_id JOIN roles ro ON ro.role_id = r.role_id WHERE fs.status_code = 'IN_PREPARATION' AND ts.status_code = 'READY' AND ro.role_name = 'COOK' AND r.is_active = true
MySQL --> RuleRepo : existe regla

OrderS -> OrderRepo : save(currentStatus=READY, currentStatusChangedAt=now)
OrderRepo -> MySQL : UPDATE customer_orders SET current_status_id = ?, current_status_changed_at = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP(6) WHERE order_id = ?
MySQL --> OrderRepo : CustomerOrder actualizada

OrderS -> HistoryRepo : save(IN_PREPARATION -> READY)
HistoryRepo -> MySQL : INSERT INTO order_status_histories(...)
MySQL --> HistoryRepo : historial creado

OrderS --> OrderC : estado actualizado
OrderC --> UI : pedido listo
UI --> Cook : confirmación

note right of OrderS
La tabla order_items permite manejar is_ready
por línea si hace falta seguimiento interno,
pero el estado global del pedido sigue esta cadena:

PENDING -> IN_PREPARATION -> READY
end note

== 6. Repartidor consulta pedidos READY ==

Courier -> UI : ingresa username
UI -> AccessC : POST /staff/identify(username)
AccessC -> StaffS : identifyActiveStaff(username)
StaffS -> StaffRepo : findByUsername(username)
StaffRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM staff WHERE username = ?
MySQL --> StaffRepo : Staff
StaffS -> RoleRepo : findById(staff.roleId)
RoleRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM roles WHERE role_id = ?
MySQL --> RoleRepo : Role(COURIER)
StaffS --> AccessC : Staff + Role
AccessC --> UI : acceso operativo
UI --> Courier : muestra menú de Repartidor

Courier -> UI : consulta pedidos listos
UI -> OrderC : GET /orders?statusCode=READY
OrderC -> QueryS : getOrdersByStatus("READY")
QueryS -> OrderRepo : findByCurrentStatusStatusCode("READY")
OrderRepo -> MySQL : SELECT co.* FROM customer_orders co JOIN order_statuses os ON os.status_id = co.current_status_id WHERE os.status_code = 'READY'
MySQL --> OrderRepo : CustomerOrder[]
QueryS --> OrderC : pedidos listos
OrderC --> UI : lista de pedidos
UI --> Courier : muestra pedidos listos

== 7. Repartidor despacha READY -> ON_THE_WAY ==

Courier -> UI : registra salida del pedido
UI -> OrderC : POST /deliveries(orderCode, courierStaffId, notes)
OrderC -> DelivS : dispatchOrder(orderCode, courierStaffId, notes)

DelivS -> OrderRepo : findByOrderCode(orderCode)
OrderRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM customer_orders WHERE order_code = ?
MySQL --> OrderRepo : CustomerOrder

DelivS -> StaffS : validateStaffRole(courierStaffId, COURIER)
StaffS -> StaffRepo : findById(courierStaffId)
StaffRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM staff WHERE staff_id = ?
MySQL --> StaffRepo : Staff
StaffS -> RoleRepo : findById(staff.roleId)
RoleRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM roles WHERE role_id = ?
MySQL --> RoleRepo : Role(COURIER)
StaffS --> DelivS : Staff válido

DelivS -> DeliveryRepo : existsByOrderOrderId(order.id)
DeliveryRepo -> MySQL : SELECT 1 FROM deliveries WHERE order_id = ?
MySQL --> DeliveryRepo : no existe delivery previa

DelivS -> StatusRepo : findByStatusCode("ON_THE_WAY")
StatusRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM order_statuses WHERE status_code = 'ON_THE_WAY'
MySQL --> StatusRepo : OrderStatus(ON_THE_WAY / En camino)

DelivS -> TransS : validateTransition(READY, ON_THE_WAY, COURIER)
TransS -> RuleRepo : existsByFromStatusStatusCodeAndToStatusStatusCodeAndRoleRoleNameAndIsActiveTrue(...)
RuleRepo -> MySQL : SELECT 1 FROM order_status_transition_rules r JOIN order_statuses fs ON fs.status_id = r.from_status_id JOIN order_statuses ts ON ts.status_id = r.to_status_id JOIN roles ro ON ro.role_id = r.role_id WHERE fs.status_code = 'READY' AND ts.status_code = 'ON_THE_WAY' AND ro.role_name = 'COURIER' AND r.is_active = true
MySQL --> RuleRepo : existe regla

DelivS -> DeliveryRepo : save(Delivery)
DeliveryRepo -> MySQL : INSERT INTO deliveries(order_id, courier_staff_id, dispatched_at, ...)
MySQL --> DeliveryRepo : Delivery creada

DelivS -> OrderRepo : save(currentStatus=ON_THE_WAY, currentStatusChangedAt=now)
OrderRepo -> MySQL : UPDATE customer_orders SET current_status_id = ?, current_status_changed_at = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP(6) WHERE order_id = ?
MySQL --> OrderRepo : CustomerOrder actualizada

DelivS -> HistoryRepo : save(READY -> ON_THE_WAY)
HistoryRepo -> MySQL : INSERT INTO order_status_histories(...)
MySQL --> HistoryRepo : historial creado

DelivS --> OrderC : despacho registrado
OrderC --> UI : pedido en camino
UI --> Courier : confirmación

== 8. Repartidor confirma ON_THE_WAY -> DELIVERED ==

Courier -> UI : confirma entrega
UI -> OrderC : PATCH /deliveries/{orderCode}/complete(receiverName, courierStaffId, notes)
OrderC -> DelivS : confirmDelivery(orderCode, receiverName, courierStaffId, notes)

DelivS -> OrderRepo : findByOrderCode(orderCode)
OrderRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM customer_orders WHERE order_code = ?
MySQL --> OrderRepo : CustomerOrder

DelivS -> DeliveryRepo : findByOrderOrderId(order.id)
DeliveryRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM deliveries WHERE order_id = ?
MySQL --> DeliveryRepo : Delivery

DelivS -> StatusRepo : findByStatusCode("DELIVERED")
StatusRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM order_statuses WHERE status_code = 'DELIVERED'
MySQL --> StatusRepo : OrderStatus(DELIVERED / Entregado)

DelivS -> TransS : validateTransition(ON_THE_WAY, DELIVERED, COURIER)
TransS -> RuleRepo : existsByFromStatusStatusCodeAndToStatusStatusCodeAndRoleRoleNameAndIsActiveTrue(...)
RuleRepo -> MySQL : SELECT 1 FROM order_status_transition_rules r JOIN order_statuses fs ON fs.status_id = r.from_status_id JOIN order_statuses ts ON ts.status_id = r.to_status_id JOIN roles ro ON ro.role_id = r.role_id WHERE fs.status_code = 'ON_THE_WAY' AND ts.status_code = 'DELIVERED' AND ro.role_name = 'COURIER' AND r.is_active = true
MySQL --> RuleRepo : existe regla

DelivS -> DeliveryRepo : save(deliveredAt, receiverName)
DeliveryRepo -> MySQL : UPDATE deliveries SET delivered_at = ?, receiver_name = ? WHERE delivery_id = ?
MySQL --> DeliveryRepo : Delivery actualizada

DelivS -> OrderRepo : save(currentStatus=DELIVERED, currentStatusChangedAt=now)
OrderRepo -> MySQL : UPDATE customer_orders SET current_status_id = ?, current_status_changed_at = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP(6) WHERE order_id = ?
MySQL --> OrderRepo : CustomerOrder actualizada

DelivS -> HistoryRepo : save(ON_THE_WAY -> DELIVERED)
HistoryRepo -> MySQL : INSERT INTO order_status_histories(...)
MySQL --> HistoryRepo : historial creado

DelivS --> OrderC : entrega confirmada
OrderC --> UI : pedido entregado
UI --> Courier : confirmación

note right of DelivS
Reglas aplicadas:
- un pedido solo puede tener una fila en deliveries
- delivered_at debe ser posterior a dispatched_at
- si delivered_at tiene valor, receiver_name es obligatorio
- customer_confirmed_at no cambia el estado operativo
end note

== 9. Cliente consulta seguimiento ==

CustomerUser -> UI : ingresa código del pedido
UI -> TrackC : GET /tracking/{orderCode}
TrackC -> QueryS : trackOrder(orderCode)

QueryS -> OrderRepo : findByOrderCode(orderCode)
OrderRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM customer_orders WHERE order_code = ?
MySQL --> OrderRepo : CustomerOrder

QueryS -> ItemRepo : findByOrderOrderId(order.id)
ItemRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM order_items WHERE order_id = ?
MySQL --> ItemRepo : OrderItem[]

QueryS -> HistoryRepo : findByOrderOrderIdOrderByChangedAtAsc(order.id)
HistoryRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM order_status_histories WHERE order_id = ? ORDER BY changed_at ASC
MySQL --> HistoryRepo : OrderStatusHistory[]

QueryS -> DeliveryRepo : findByOrderOrderId(order.id)
DeliveryRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM deliveries WHERE order_id = ?
MySQL --> DeliveryRepo : Delivery?

QueryS --> TrackC : detalle + historial + entrega
TrackC --> UI : respuesta de seguimiento
UI --> CustomerUser : muestra estado actual e historial

== 10. Cliente confirma recepción ==

CustomerUser -> UI : confirma recepción del pedido
UI -> TrackC : POST /tracking/{orderCode}/confirm-receipt(customerId, notes)
TrackC -> DelivS : confirmCustomerReceipt(orderCode, customerId, notes)

DelivS -> OrderRepo : findByOrderCode(orderCode)
OrderRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM customer_orders WHERE order_code = ?
MySQL --> OrderRepo : CustomerOrder

DelivS -> DeliveryRepo : findByOrderOrderId(order.id)
DeliveryRepo -> MySQL : SELECT * FROM deliveries WHERE order_id = ?
MySQL --> DeliveryRepo : Delivery

alt pedido pertenece al cliente y ya está entregado
  DelivS -> DeliveryRepo : save(customerConfirmedAt, customerConfirmationNotes)
  DeliveryRepo -> MySQL : UPDATE deliveries SET customer_confirmed_at = ?, customer_confirmation_notes = ? WHERE delivery_id = ?
  MySQL --> DeliveryRepo : Delivery actualizada

  DelivS --> TrackC : recepción confirmada
  TrackC --> UI : confirmación registrada
  UI --> CustomerUser : muestra recepción confirmada
else no cumple reglas de confirmación
  DelivS --> TrackC : error de negocio
  TrackC --> UI : no se puede confirmar la recepción
  UI --> CustomerUser : muestra error
end

note right of TrackC
El cliente puede:
- consultar estado actual
- consultar historial
- confirmar recepción

No puede cambiar estados operativos.
La confirmación del cliente se guarda en:
deliveries.customer_confirmed_at
end note

note over UI,MySQL
Tablas principales alineadas al modelo vigente:

- roles
- staff
- customers
- customer_addresses
- products
- order_statuses
- order_status_transition_rules
- customer_orders
- order_items
- order_status_histories
- deliveries

Claves de negocio importantes:
- role_name define el rol operativo
- status_code gobierna las transiciones
- status_name es la etiqueta visible
- order_code identifica el pedido hacia afuera
end note

@enduml
